hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"163","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Mujhe bakhsh de, mujh par raham kar aur mujhe aala rafeeq [jannat mein nekon] se mila de. [Maut ke marz mein padhe]"
"164","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; beshak maut ki sakraat hain. [Maut ke waqt padhe]"
"165","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, Allah sab se bada hai; Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin akela; Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin akela, beshareek; badshahat usi ki hai, tareef usi ki hai; Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; Allah ke baghair koi taqat-quvvat nahin. [Maut ke waqt padhe]"
